reconstructed fixtures/server-log/v8_1/webservice/forbidden.* (the 403 texts of feature 020 research D-5 as a node error of the node lookup; research.md "Static facts": GetNodeRequest checks the Configuration permission first, identical in 9.0.10).
Frames as in the 8.1 case in the REST_90 variant: start REST_90 instead of start SOAP_81, without the two log4j lines of the 8.1 SOAP client, with the REST client's netty line after start taken over from the recorded fixtures/queue-entry/v9_0/not_found_file.frames (9.0.10). The marker text, the message and the exception class are invented, as in the 8.1 case. Not verified against a 9.0 client or server.
